        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Prince, Patty Jenkins, Don Amendolia\n- Projects: Purple Rain Tour, Purple Rain\n- Organizations: Rock and Roll Hall of Fame\n- Roles: film director, screenwriter, acting coach\n\nFacts:\n- Patricia Lea Jenkins was born on July 24, 1971, and she is an American film director and screenwriter.\n- The Purple Rain Tour was the fifth concert tour by Prince and The Revolution.\n- The Purple Rain Tour followed the success of Prince's sixth studio album \"Purple Rain\" and his 1984 film \"Purple Rain\".\n- Don Amendolia is credited with giving acting lessons to the entire cast of the film \"Purple Rain\".\n- Prince was inducted into the Rock and Roll Hall of Fame in 2004, which was his first year of eligibility.",
